      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Each selection would be a \"button\", so it should use the lighter green background to indicate it is selectable. Nowhere else on the UI do the light turquoise icon touch the dark green background directly. Also color would be more helpful here, especially for emojis. And for the fact that people can use color in their own expression menus on their avatars, it would be good to set a good precedent.",
